@startuml F5.9-ERRO-D04-parcial
title F5.9-ERRO-D04 — Processamento parcial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ImportController" as Ctrl
participant "ConfirmImportUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /importacoes/{jobId}/confirm
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: lote 1 COMMIT
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC -> Postgres: lote 2
Postgres --> UC: erro (ROLLBACK)
UC -> Postgres: status PARTIAL\n+ outbox
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> WebApp: 200 PARTIAL
WebApp --> Sec: relatório parcial

@enduml
